
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. COUNT-TEMPLATE.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

01 WS-VALUE           PIC 9(2).

01 WS-COUNT-SUCCESS   PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
01 WS-COUNT-WARNING   PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
01 WS-COUNT-FAILURE   PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.

    MOVE 0  TO WS-VALUE
    PERFORM 1000-CLASSIFY

    MOVE 4  TO WS-VALUE
    PERFORM 1000-CLASSIFY

    MOVE 8  TO WS-VALUE
    PERFORM 1000-CLASSIFY

    MOVE 0  TO WS-VALUE
    PERFORM 1000-CLASSIFY

    MOVE 12 TO WS-VALUE
    PERFORM 1000-CLASSIFY

    PERFORM 2000-DISPLAY-RESULTS

    STOP RUN.

1000-CLASSIFY.
    EVALUATE WS-VALUE
        WHEN 0
            ADD 1 TO WS-COUNT-SUCCESS
        WHEN 4
            ADD 1 TO WS-COUNT-WARNING
        WHEN OTHER
            ADD 1 TO WS-COUNT-FAILURE
    END-EVALUATE
    .

2000-DISPLAY-RESULTS.
    DISPLAY "SUCCESS: " WS-COUNT-SUCCESS
    DISPLAY "WARNING: " WS-COUNT-WARNING
    DISPLAY "FAILURE: " WS-COUNT-FAILURE
    .
